      "id": "be-s11-rothschild-lerner-c2",
      "heading": "The Lerner index",
      "explanation_md": "**L = (P - MC) / P**\n\nIf a firm charges exactly its marginal cost, L = 0: it has **no market power**. The higher the markup, the closer L gets to **1**, meaning **weak price competition** and **market power**.",
